OL,3,GNEWSAHertfordshire councils'
OL,4,Arestructure plans dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to abolish 11 councils in
OL,7,FHertfordshire and replace them with
OL,8,Ffour unitary authorities have been
OL,9,Fdropped by the government.
OL,11,FIt means elections for its existing
OL,12,Fcouncils will go ahead based on current
OL,13,Fcounty boundaries in May 2027, with
OL,14,Fshadow elections for any new
OL,15,Fauthorities due to take place no
OL,16,Fearlier than May 2028.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
