OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHertfordshire councils'
OL,4,Arestructure plans dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FMayor of Watford, Liberal Democrat
OL,7,FPeter Taylor, said: "This whole process
OL,8,Fhas been a shambles. Today's
OL,9,Fannouncement creates even more
OL,10,Funcertainty for councils and local
OL,11,Fcommunities."
OL,13,FLocal government minister, Jim McMahon,
OL,14,Fsaid "every area [in the country] will
OL,15,Fhave an outcome by early next year",
OL,16,Fwith plans for Hertfordshire's future
OL,17,Fremaining under consideration.
